  "solution": [
    "The region lies between $y = x^2$ (below) and $y = 2x$ (above) for $0 \\le x \\le 2$, so $0 \\le y \\le 4$.",
    "For fixed $y$, $x$ runs from the line $x = y/2$ to the parabola $x = \\sqrt{y}$: $\\int_0^4 \\int_{y/2}^{\\sqrt y} x\\,dx\\,dy$."
  ],
